      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Diamonds used to be coal",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Look young 'cause they got soul",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "That's why they're beautiful",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And my heart used to be cold",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "'Til your hands laid on my soul",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Baby, and that's why you're beautiful",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm not wonderin' why the sky's blue",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That's not my business",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "All I know is I look up and tell myself",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "\"Be patient, love, that could be us\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
